Running

nm *.so -C -o --defined-only --print-size --size-sort -t d

gives

....
survTMB.so:0000000001188624 0000000000026226 W Eigen::internal::gebp_kernel<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> >, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> >, long, Eigen::internal::blas_data_mapper<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> >, long, 0, 0>, 2, 4, false, false>::operator()(Eigen::internal::blas_data_mapper<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> >, long, 0, 0> const&, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > const*, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > const*, long, long, long, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> >, long, long, long, long)
survTMB.so:0000000001233136 0000000000029181 t Eigen::internal::gebp_kernel<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > >, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > >, long, Eigen::internal::blas_data_mapper<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > >, long, 0, 0>, 2, 4, false, false>::operator()(Eigen::internal::blas_data_mapper<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > >, long, 0, 0> const&, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > > const*, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > > const*, long, long, long, CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > >, long, long, long, long) [clone .constprop.1172]
survTMB.so:0000000002155216 0000000000040102 t ____C_A_T_C_H____T_E_S_T____0()
survTMB.so:0000000012873888 0000000003840000 V CppAD::recorder<double>::PutPar(double const&)::hash_table
survTMB.so:0000000009030400 0000000003840000 V CppAD::recorder<CppAD::AD<double> >::PutPar(CppAD::AD<double> const&)::hash_table
survTMB.so:0000000005190400 0000000003840000 V CppAD::recorder<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > >::PutPar(CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > const&)::hash_table

so there is not really any large objects or symbols (apart from three fixed size array which are not that big anyway). Bulding the package with "-g" yields a total package size of 125 MB while it is below 5MB with a .so file of size 3.4 without "-g".

Using

nm *.so -C -o --debug-syms --print-size --size-sort -t d

instead yields

survTMB.so:0000000009029792 0000000003840000 V CppAD::recorder<double>::PutPar(double const&)::hash_table
survTMB.so:0000000005186304 0000000003840000 V CppAD::recorder<CppAD::AD<double> >::PutPar(CppAD::AD<double> const&)::hash_table
survTMB.so:0000000012877376 0000000003840000 V CppAD::recorder<CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > >::PutPar(CppAD::AD<CppAD::AD<double> > const&)::hash_table
survTMB.so:0000000000000000 0000000006059467 N .debug_line
survTMB.so:0000000000000000 0000000006699984 N .debug_ranges
survTMB.so:0000000000000000 0000000029831934 N .debug_str
survTMB.so:0000000000000000 0000000035818052 N .debug_loc
survTMB.so:0000000000000000 0000000051719075 N .debug_info

Essentially confirming that it is all debug information.

